// Package demoformats holds parsing/round-trip tests for the on-disk artifacts a
// real drand node produces. The fixtures under testdata/node were generated by
// running `make demo` (a full 6-node DKG + beacon run on the default
// pedersen-bls-chained scheme) and copying one node's data directory verbatim:
//
//	dkg.db                                   the DKG state boltdb
//	multibeacon/default/db/drand.db          the beacon boltdb (trimmed format)
//	multibeacon/default/groups/drand_group.toml  the group file
//	multibeacon/default/groups/dist_key.private  the distributed key share
//	multibeacon/default/key/drand_id.public      the node public identity
//	multibeacon/default/key/drand_id.private     the node private key
//
// These are throwaway demo keys, not secrets. The tests make sure drand can still
// load every one of these files with the loaders it uses in production.
package demoformats
